WEBVTT

00:18.780 --> 00:20.870
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

01:31.480 --> 01:34.530
My, what a wretched hovel this is.

01:35.150 --> 01:40.070
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

01:36.290 --> 01:37.170
Here, Sire.

01:36.700 --> 01:40.070
<b>The Devil and the Hero Take the First Steps toward a New Dream</b>

01:36.700 --> 01:40.070
<b>The Devil and the Hero Take the First Steps toward a New Dream</b>

01:37.170 --> 01:38.080
Thanks.

01:41.900 --> 01:45.540
So, the Malebranche, eh?

01:46.030 --> 01:50.880
Not even begging could induce me to use 
magic from those who defy your orders.

01:51.310 --> 01:55.510
Oh, good. It sounds like you 
don't plan to go along with them.

01:55.510 --> 01:56.560
Of course not.

01:58.790 --> 02:04.640
Hey, Chiho, how'd you manage to cross 
Erone's force field without doing anything?

02:04.640 --> 02:08.970
If I were to speculate, perhaps 
it's because Erone and Chiho's rings

02:08.970 --> 02:12.030
are both of sephiric origin.

02:14.150 --> 02:15.650
The issue...

02:15.650 --> 02:18.930
...is that a demon was ordering him around.

02:18.930 --> 02:20.740
Indeed.

02:20.740 --> 02:25.060
W-Wait! Sariel, you know of Alas Ramus?

02:25.060 --> 02:26.630
Yes.

02:26.630 --> 02:30.760
However, I wasn't informed 
of any problem with Geburah.

02:31.360 --> 02:36.300
Gah! Why would you serve hot tea 
at this time of year?!

02:37.550 --> 02:42.160
Anyway, if he's obeying 
Farfarello, can't we ignore him

02:42.160 --> 02:44.050
and just beat Farfarello?

02:44.050 --> 02:45.180
You're a fool.

02:46.210 --> 02:50.940
If we defeat Farfarello, there's a 100% 
chance that someone else will come.

02:50.940 --> 02:53.720
Then encouraging a rational decision to leave

02:53.720 --> 02:57.570
is the best way to avoid future problems?

02:57.570 --> 03:02.820
Yeah. I maybe acted a little too hastily.

03:04.240 --> 03:07.080
I instinctively guarded Chi.

03:07.080 --> 03:11.630
Unless he's an idiot, he'll have 
figured out that we know her.

03:11.630 --> 03:12.800
And...

03:12.800 --> 03:17.960
He may have realized I can't fight. Right?

03:19.550 --> 03:22.220
Me? I'd take her hostage.

03:23.470 --> 03:28.220
It's an effective tactic. 
That's why I did it.

03:29.040 --> 03:30.850
This is what we feared.

03:32.880 --> 03:39.010
Mister Sariel, would you please 
help train me in idea linking?

03:40.450 --> 03:43.990
Are you mad? There's no benefit to me.

03:43.990 --> 03:46.240
It might take some time,

03:46.760 --> 03:50.240
but I'll look for a way to help 
you and Miss Kisaki make up.

03:51.250 --> 03:53.750
Let the training begin!

03:53.750 --> 03:55.020
Yes, sir!

03:55.020 --> 03:57.880
Will Chiho Sasaki be all right?

03:57.880 --> 03:59.260
There's no alternative.

03:59.260 --> 04:02.510
It's the other one we have to worry about.

04:03.170 --> 04:08.000
If Farfarello goes home convinced of 
our rightness, this all ends peacefully.

04:08.000 --> 04:14.520
Which means we need him to see Miss Sasaki 
as a vital part of His Majesty's plan.

04:14.520 --> 04:20.900
Sure, a holy spell from her may get him 
to take her seriously, but still...

04:20.900 --> 04:24.320
It's a gamble, but convincing 
Farfarello is our only play.

04:24.320 --> 04:32.910
A new morning has come. 
It's a morning full of hope!

04:32.910 --> 04:37.540
Interesting. So the <i>way</i> you 
free your mind doesn't matter?

04:37.970 --> 04:42.550
I used hymns to train, but I don't 
think we've taught her that yet.

04:42.550 --> 04:46.300
Right... but why the radio exercise song?

04:46.900 --> 04:49.870
I really like this song!

04:50.470 --> 04:53.430
Bel! You send her something now!

04:53.800 --> 04:55.590
If she gets the hang of receiving,

04:55.590 --> 04:59.470
maybe she can use that sensation 
to figure out sending!

04:59.470 --> 05:00.800
Understood!

05:00.800 --> 05:02.440
Thank you!

05:02.440 --> 05:05.830
<i>What should I send her, though?</i>

05:05.830 --> 05:10.360
<i>What would trigger her to reverse 
my desired flow of communication?</i>

05:12.930 --> 05:19.810
Good Chiho, do you wish to ma—er, 
exchange nuptial vows with the Devil?

05:22.460 --> 05:24.470
Suzuno?! Chi?!

05:26.090 --> 05:28.490
M-M-M-M-Ma...

05:32.350 --> 05:35.870
It would seem she's overcome the first hurdle.

05:36.240 --> 05:40.730
Bel certainly appeared 
to receive her idea link.

05:41.750 --> 05:44.270
I thought my head might explode...

05:45.410 --> 05:49.740
Shall we train at the same 
time tomorrow, then?

05:49.740 --> 05:51.490
That will be fine.

05:51.490 --> 05:55.980
I could reserve tomorrow from 1:00 to 4:00.

05:55.980 --> 05:57.640
Check out Mister Coordinator.

05:57.640 --> 05:59.580
Will that suit every—

06:00.250 --> 06:02.750
What is it, Sariel?

06:04.260 --> 06:05.760
Miss Kisaki!

06:05.760 --> 06:09.540
Hmm? Oh, it's you guys.

06:09.540 --> 06:11.960
Fancy meeting you here.

06:12.640 --> 06:15.140
What brought you here, Miss Kisaki?

06:15.140 --> 06:18.640
What are <i>you</i> doing here, Mitsuki Sarue?

06:18.640 --> 06:21.700
U-Uh, w-well... u-um...

06:21.700 --> 06:24.360
Th-The thing is, er...

06:24.360 --> 06:29.660
You better not intend to mess with 
MgRonald's customers or my crew again.

06:29.660 --> 06:33.410
I-I-I-I'm here because I live in this building!

06:33.410 --> 06:35.160
<b>Space for Rent</b>

06:33.410 --> 06:35.170
You do?

06:36.650 --> 06:39.290
My goal is to be a barman.

06:39.580 --> 06:42.170
Miss Kisaki, don't tell me you're quitting Mg—

06:42.170 --> 06:44.590
You're jumping to conclusions.

06:42.170 --> 06:57.180
<b>Space for Rent</b>

06:45.010 --> 06:50.870
But it's true that I've been 
acting oddly for the past few days

06:50.870 --> 06:57.180
because the new MgCafé kind of 
brought back my longtime dream...

06:57.180 --> 06:59.690
Longtime dream?

06:59.690 --> 07:04.190
Yes. Adults have dreams 
for the future too, you know.

07:04.480 --> 07:11.320
I find myself wanting to see how 
far I can fight on my own power.

07:11.630 --> 07:15.950
Do you think you might start 
your own café one day, ma'am?

07:15.950 --> 07:20.830
It's less of a plan and more 
of a "that would be nice."

07:21.440 --> 07:25.980
If you're looking at real estate, 
that seems pretty concrete.

07:25.980 --> 07:28.310
There are still plenty of things I want to do

07:28.310 --> 07:30.340
that MgRonald's is my ticket to doing.

07:30.940 --> 07:34.490
I got a big head and tried 
impressing our regulars

07:34.490 --> 07:37.490
by using what I know 
of their coffee preferences...

07:37.490 --> 07:39.370
But whew, it was hard!

07:39.370 --> 07:41.630
I-I had no idea.

07:41.630 --> 07:45.730
Then the coffee you made for us was...

07:45.730 --> 07:49.370
Maa, you like your coffee 
bitter and not too hot.

07:49.370 --> 07:52.240
And Chi, you like plenty 
of cream and no sugar.

07:52.240 --> 07:58.990
It was a little underhanded of me, but I did
 up your respect for me as manager.

07:59.410 --> 08:04.500
But don't take this to mean that 
the MgR's barista training is pointless.

08:05.140 --> 08:08.500
If you learn more about 
the products you handle now,

08:08.500 --> 08:12.760
it'll pave the way to a world 
of new knowledge and technology.

08:13.460 --> 08:17.880
All dreams are reached through 
one small step after another.

08:18.230 --> 08:24.770
With enough determination and 
wherewithal, humans can dream big.

08:25.240 --> 08:29.980
Still, I think it'll be a while 
before I talk about my dreams again.

08:30.620 --> 08:32.400
Sorry I stopped you.

08:32.400 --> 08:36.630
Please, come by MgR's next time 
you're in the neighborhood.

08:36.630 --> 08:37.500
Good night.

08:42.070 --> 08:47.540
And <i>you</i>. I hear you're so depressed 
lately because I banned you from MgR's.

08:48.970 --> 08:54.620
Now it feels like I'm using 
your feelings for me to hurt SFC.

08:54.620 --> 08:55.950
I don't like it.

08:56.340 --> 08:59.750
Trouncing a business rival 
outside the business arena

08:59.750 --> 09:01.810
is no fit behavior for a barman.

09:02.180 --> 09:03.910
Y-You mean...?

09:03.910 --> 09:05.990
Come whenever you want.

09:05.990 --> 09:10.570
But be warned: I'll sue your ass 
the next time you step out of line.

09:12.920 --> 09:15.800
So all's well that ends well?

09:15.800 --> 09:17.200
M-Maybe?

09:18.850 --> 09:20.450
S-Sariel?

09:22.450 --> 09:25.460
Mister Sariel, you're floating!

09:26.260 --> 09:32.460
To start off, you'll be watching a 20-minute DVD

09:32.460 --> 09:34.970
explaining what type of business MgCafé is.

09:35.290 --> 09:39.140
Then we'll get into the meat of this course.

09:39.140 --> 09:41.860
Now, please watch the video.

09:48.470 --> 09:50.430
What is this?

09:51.650 --> 09:55.740
Farfarello isn't here. It's just me.

09:55.740 --> 09:59.000
Have you been sneaking 
around behind a barrier?

09:59.380 --> 10:05.000
I was told to find out what you're 
doing to achieve world conquest.

10:05.590 --> 10:09.500
What is this? Is it necessary 
for world conquest?

10:09.500 --> 10:14.850
Yeah, it is. That's why I'm here studying.

10:14.850 --> 10:15.880
"Studying"?

10:15.880 --> 10:21.640
Right, "studying" means taking action 
to learn things you don't know.

10:22.000 --> 10:23.770
Oh, I see.

10:24.390 --> 10:30.450
My army had no idea what it meant 
for a government to rule its people.

10:31.000 --> 10:36.230
I'm prepping for conquest 
here in Japan to study that.

10:36.230 --> 10:37.810
This class is part of it.

10:38.400 --> 10:40.320
It's my next step

10:38.400 --> 10:44.660
<b><i>Our Vision for the Future</i></b>

10:40.790 --> 10:44.660
toward my dream of a new 
kind of world conquest.

10:45.070 --> 10:47.510
New... dream...

10:48.030 --> 10:49.670
Sounds fun.

10:52.460 --> 10:57.020
On to today's lecture. 
Everyone, open your text.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.930
Chi, back there I—

11:08.580 --> 11:10.190
Come with me.

11:13.920 --> 11:15.040
All right.

11:15.040 --> 11:17.040


11:15.940 --> 11:17.940
<b>Café Dotour</b>

11:21.450 --> 11:23.450
Isn't that the Devil?

11:23.450 --> 11:26.950
He's acting strangely. Where is Chiho?

11:27.690 --> 11:28.450
Maou!

11:29.230 --> 11:30.630
Have you seen Chi?

11:30.630 --> 11:32.400
Has she disappeared?

11:32.400 --> 11:33.600
When?!

11:33.600 --> 11:34.840
Just now.

11:35.620 --> 11:41.970
None of us noticed, which means she was 
probably kidnapped with Erone's barrier.

11:41.970 --> 11:45.470
Oh, well. I suppose I'll help.

11:46.950 --> 11:50.850
There's a shard of Yesod 
on her left hand, right?

11:52.040 --> 11:53.480
Moon Mirror!

12:00.010 --> 12:02.650
Anticlimactic. She's right nearby.

12:02.650 --> 12:03.680
Really?!

12:03.680 --> 12:08.910
As fate would have it, there's a barrier 
around the roof of that building.

12:12.820 --> 12:14.420
Emi. Suzuno.

12:15.130 --> 12:16.920
Sorry, but I need your power.

12:16.920 --> 12:19.050
And just how do want us to give it to you?

12:19.570 --> 12:21.080
I noticed something.

12:21.550 --> 12:25.430
I'm a human now, just like Chi.

12:25.430 --> 12:26.930
Pardon?

12:27.260 --> 12:31.810
I hear you came willingly. Why is that?

12:31.810 --> 12:35.690
You might have injured me if I resisted.

12:35.690 --> 12:39.690
You have steadier nerves 
than your appearance suggests.

12:39.690 --> 12:42.690
A lot of scary things have happened to me.

12:42.690 --> 12:44.950
I see. Well, then...

12:47.890 --> 12:48.970
Eep!

12:51.520 --> 12:52.950
How about this?

12:53.990 --> 12:56.710
Oh, you're wearing underwear.

12:56.710 --> 13:00.060
You're not fazed by my true form?

13:00.060 --> 13:04.340
Um, I thought your transformation 
would be a little more dramatic.

13:05.350 --> 13:08.850
Frankly, now I <i>want</i> to kill you.

13:08.850 --> 13:10.910
S-S-Sorry.

13:10.910 --> 13:16.300
Um, it's true that Satan hasn't given up 
on his dream of world conquest.

13:16.880 --> 13:21.610
He's learning something in Japan 
so that he can use it for his campaign.

13:21.610 --> 13:23.110
Studying, right?

13:23.690 --> 13:25.270
Yep.

13:25.270 --> 13:31.490
So I'd like you to tell me why 
the Devil's army invaded Ente Isla.

13:31.840 --> 13:35.610
Why did you need to conquer Ente Isla?

13:35.990 --> 13:38.380
Why do you want to know?

13:38.880 --> 13:40.380
Why else?

13:40.700 --> 13:46.170
<i>To figure out why it went wrong, 
so I can help with Satan's dream!</i>

13:46.170 --> 13:51.510
<i>Lately, he's been saying that the way 
he did things before was a mistake.</i>

13:51.510 --> 13:55.430
<i>But he doesn't seem to know 
what he should've done instead...</i>

13:52.550 --> 13:55.430
Chiho is doing a multi-recipient idea link!

13:55.430 --> 13:57.690
She shouldn't be capable of that yet.

13:57.250 --> 14:01.590
<i>I want to help Satan if I can!</i>

13:57.690 --> 14:01.060
Is she doing it unconsciously, then?

14:03.920 --> 14:06.390
Aren't you a human?

14:06.390 --> 14:08.010
I'm a human.

14:08.010 --> 14:12.330
Then why do you want to help demons like us?

14:12.330 --> 14:15.350
It's not about demons versus humans.

14:15.350 --> 14:18.330
If they can do it now, they should 
be able to keep it up forever.

14:18.330 --> 14:20.000
<i>If they can do it now, they should 
be able to keep it up forever.</i>

14:20.000 --> 14:23.590
<i>There can be a kind of world conquest 
where the Devil and the Hero get along.</i>

14:25.340 --> 14:28.060
It's a different world conquest

14:28.530 --> 14:31.900
than King Satan was thinking 
of before he came to this world.

14:31.900 --> 14:33.470
What is it, then?

14:33.470 --> 14:35.260
One where 
the Devil and the Hero...

14:35.260 --> 14:40.940
where demons and humans work 
together so everyone can eat.

14:41.450 --> 14:45.230
That's the conquest I'm going to help with.

14:48.150 --> 14:50.240
Farfarello, a barrier.

14:56.620 --> 14:58.000
Mister Maou?

14:58.000 --> 14:58.990
You're okay?

14:58.990 --> 15:00.000
Y-Yes!

15:03.750 --> 15:08.260
Wait, it's not like that! Mister Farlello 
hasn't done anything to me!

15:08.600 --> 15:10.260
Farfarello.

15:10.580 --> 15:16.420
Chi apparently wants to defend you, 
but clearly you did kidnap her.

15:16.420 --> 15:17.770
What's your game?

15:17.770 --> 15:23.020
Respectfully, Sire, I wanted to 
hear your story from a third party.

15:23.020 --> 15:29.300
And, um, I wanted to know why 
you had to conquer Ente Isla.

15:29.900 --> 15:31.280
I see.

15:31.640 --> 15:34.910
Ask me that crap <i>directly</i>, you two.

15:35.910 --> 15:39.540
I'm right here. I won't run or hide.

15:39.540 --> 15:41.630
You're right. I'm sorry!

15:41.630 --> 15:42.770
Farfarello.

15:42.770 --> 15:43.680
Yes?

15:43.680 --> 15:45.650
Do you know what this is?

15:45.650 --> 15:50.420
I do, Sire. It's what humans trade 
for goods and services, correct?

15:50.420 --> 15:52.770
Yes. It's money.

15:52.770 --> 15:56.610
If we have this, we won't even need magic.

15:56.610 --> 16:01.310
You claim a scrap of paper 
has more power than magic?

16:01.310 --> 16:06.040
We'll <i>give</i> it that power. 
Our wills change the world.

16:06.490 --> 16:09.750
I learned that in this world.

16:09.750 --> 16:14.570
What can such a thing mean 
in the face of true might?

16:15.190 --> 16:19.700
Nothing yet. But I'm about 
to build its meaning.

16:20.270 --> 16:27.090
Then even the Hero who tried to 
kill me will lend me her power.

16:28.850 --> 16:34.330
Excuse me, could you not give people the 
impression that I'm helping you for money?

16:34.330 --> 16:36.080
Sing, Chi.

16:36.940 --> 16:39.600
Activate some more and protect yourself.

16:45.910 --> 16:48.110
Wh-What are all of you doing?!

16:48.110 --> 16:49.270
Don't move!

16:49.860 --> 16:52.440
Hey, you'd better be able to take this.

16:53.080 --> 16:56.770
No need to be scared. Just watch—
I'm gonna blow your minds.

16:58.310 --> 16:59.370
Hey!

17:03.200 --> 17:10.820
A new morning has come. 
It's a morning full of hope!

17:10.820 --> 17:18.250
Spread your arms wide with joy 
and look up at the sky!

17:18.250 --> 17:21.860
Listen to the radio voice,

17:21.860 --> 17:29.030
spread your healthy arms 
to the fragrant wind...

17:29.030 --> 17:31.900
One, two, three!

17:32.710 --> 17:35.900
Whoops, almost passed out there.

17:35.900 --> 17:37.780
He's big now.

17:37.780 --> 17:40.140
I didn't know this was possible.

17:40.510 --> 17:42.120
What happened?!

17:42.120 --> 17:43.630
You get it, right, Chi?

17:43.630 --> 17:45.540
I-I think so.

17:46.250 --> 17:51.420
Bodies react to an overdose 
of celestial force by producing magic.

17:51.420 --> 17:54.310
Normally it poisons them,

17:54.310 --> 17:59.180
but I wondered what it'd do 
to <i>Sadao Maou's</i> human body.

17:59.180 --> 18:03.680
Hold on, did you use my and Bel's 
celestial force to experiment?!

18:03.680 --> 18:05.680
K-King Satan...

18:05.680 --> 18:09.190
Well? Are you satisfied now?

18:10.260 --> 18:13.660
I was rash and thoughtless, Sire.

18:13.660 --> 18:17.200
Please punish my crime however you will.

18:17.200 --> 18:19.690
Who said anything about that?

18:20.430 --> 18:23.080
When you get home, you tell Barbariccia

18:23.720 --> 18:30.330
about the <i>true</i> new Devil's army 
I found here and its four great generals.

18:32.620 --> 18:36.940
First, Alciel and Lucifer. 
You remember them.

18:36.940 --> 18:39.810
For new additions, here's Emilia the Hero.

18:39.810 --> 18:43.890
She may be stronger than me. 
She's a battle expert.

18:43.890 --> 18:44.720
Hey!

18:45.310 --> 18:48.190
There's Doctrinal Correction Council 
investigator Deathscythe Bel.

18:48.730 --> 18:51.540
Her background in the 
Church's Missionary Division

18:51.540 --> 18:54.510
makes her an expert in all Ente 
Islan affairs, and a wise general.

18:54.510 --> 18:55.730
Wh-What?

18:55.730 --> 18:58.930
And there's the one who brought 
these former enemies together.

18:58.930 --> 19:02.020
The crux of our operation to win the hearts 
of the people, and also my aide.

19:02.020 --> 19:04.950
MgRonald's barista Chiho Sasaki!

19:06.080 --> 19:11.010
Those are the four great generals 
of the new Devil's army I'm building.

19:11.010 --> 19:11.780
That's five!

19:11.780 --> 19:14.220
And more importantly, what the hell?!

19:14.220 --> 19:17.260
Don't just declare me your general!

19:17.260 --> 19:20.490
I'm a general now!

19:20.490 --> 19:22.760
This isn't something to be happy about!

19:22.760 --> 19:27.530
What are they doing? I'm dissolving 
the barrier if they don't need it.

19:30.520 --> 19:33.430
Take that with you. It's my magic.

19:33.430 --> 19:38.730
I'm sure word of the new four generals 
will boost morale in the demon realm.

19:38.730 --> 19:40.900
I said I'm not his general!

19:44.880 --> 19:46.060
Erone.

19:46.060 --> 19:48.900
Alas Ramus. Long time.

19:48.900 --> 19:51.910
Yeah. Is everyone okay?

19:51.910 --> 19:56.350
I don't know, sorry. But <i>I'm</i> okay.

19:57.060 --> 19:58.680
Let's play again later.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.670
Yeah.

20:07.350 --> 20:11.590
Correct the record, Satan. 
There can't be five "four generals."

20:11.590 --> 20:16.060
Four generals, eight princes, 
who cares? No big difference.

20:16.060 --> 20:19.560
You want <i>more</i>? The number 
isn't even the iss—

20:19.560 --> 20:22.060
Papa! Me too!

20:22.060 --> 20:23.690
Sure, of course!

20:23.690 --> 20:27.330
Hey! Would you stop it 
with the nonsense decisions?

20:28.370 --> 20:32.210
Okay, Emi, if you think it's such nonsense,

20:32.520 --> 20:35.710
then follow me so you can keep an eye on me.

20:36.330 --> 20:37.710
Excuse me?

20:37.710 --> 20:40.160
You're struggling, right?

20:40.660 --> 20:44.110
You don't know whether to 
keep treating me as an enemy.

20:44.640 --> 20:49.200
So start over and judge again 
whether I'm your enemy.

20:49.800 --> 20:50.550
Well?

20:50.550 --> 20:52.730
W-Well, what?

20:52.730 --> 20:54.370
Let's clean slate this.

20:55.290 --> 20:59.980
I'll prove with my actions that 
I'm not the Devil you think I am.

20:59.980 --> 21:03.000
Emilia the Hero, follow me.

21:03.480 --> 21:07.990
In the process of my world conquest, 
I'll show you a whole new world.

21:11.120 --> 21:13.650
He can be smooth when he wants to be.

21:13.980 --> 21:15.900
You idiot! <i>Idiot</i>!

21:15.900 --> 21:20.000
Do you even know what you're saying,
 you insensitive brute?!

21:20.000 --> 21:21.170
What?

21:22.270 --> 21:23.260
Chi?

21:23.790 --> 21:27.140
Mister Maou, buy me some cake.

21:27.140 --> 21:28.040
Huh?

21:28.390 --> 21:31.390
My birthday is coming up.

21:31.390 --> 21:35.950
Where's this coming from? I mean, I was 
planning to give you a present, but...

21:37.000 --> 21:39.550
Why do you seem angry, too?

21:39.550 --> 21:40.650
Not telling!

21:40.650 --> 21:42.640
Come on, let's go!

21:42.640 --> 21:44.410
Cake! Cake!

21:44.410 --> 21:47.220
How beautiful is friendship.

21:47.650 --> 21:52.160
And now I'll go eat dinner! My first MgCafé!

23:24.970 --> 23:25.800
Emilia.

23:27.260 --> 23:30.680
You and I need to start thinking about this.

23:31.210 --> 23:33.050
We learned that angels are people.

23:33.050 --> 23:37.950
So what do you think that makes demons?
